<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Kai Peng trading suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Kai Peng trading suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of engineering firm Kai Peng Bhd were suspended on Monday at the company's request, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Officials at the company could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>Kai Peng stock rose 20 cents to 13.10 ringgit prior to the suspension.</p>
<p>The company is involved in mechanical and civil engineering.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 206 2323)</p>
</text>
